        {
          "_type": "FunctionDef",
          "_fields": {
            "name": "_evaluate_strategy_surface",
            "args": {
              "_type": "arguments",
              "_fields": {
                "posonlyargs": [],
                "args": [
                  {
                    "_type": "arg",
                    "_fields": {
                      "arg": "strategy",
                      "annotation": {
                        "_type": "Name",
                        "_fields": {
                          "id": "StrategyResult",
                          "ctx": {
                            "_type": "Load",
                            "_fields": {}
                          }
                        },
                        "_lineno": 85,
                        "_col_offset": 41
                      },
                      "type_comment": "None"
                    },
                    "_lineno": 85,
                    "_col_offset": 31
                  }
                ],
                "vararg": "None",
                "kwonlyargs": [],
                "kw_defaults": [],
                "kwarg": "None",
                "defaults": []
              }
            },
            "body": [
              {
                "_type": "Expr",
                "_fields": {
                  "value": {
                    "_type": "Constant",
                    "_fields": {
                      "value": "\n    Inspect StrategyResult and decide whether the strategy surface needs correction.\n\n    Heuristics (deterministic, non-LLM):\n\n        \u2022 If there are zero branches \u2192 severe issue \u2192 retry strategy.\n        \u2022 If chosen_branch_id is None or invalid:\n             \u2013 severity = 3 (severe)\n             \u2013 recommended_action = \"retry_strategy\"\n        \u2022 If chosen branch text is suspiciously short (e.g., < 40 chars):\n             \u2013 severity = 2 (moderate)\n             \u2013 recommended_action = \"retry_strategy\"\n        \u2022 Otherwise:\n             \u2013 severity = 0 (no correction)\n    ",
                      "kind": "None"
                    },
                    "_lineno": 86,
                    "_col_offset": 4
                  }
                },
                "_lineno": 86,
                "_col_offset": 4
              },
